  "description": "**This work contains depictions of hermaphroditism and coercive acts. Viewer discretion is advised.**\n\nPark Yeonseo harbors a secret: they are intersex.\n\nOne day, after their father’s death, Yeonseo finds themself burdened with his debts. Then a mysterious man, Tae Shinju, appears before them. Shinju interferes in his half-brother’s affairs and declares that he will now be managing Yeonseo’s debt himself.\n\n*“Sleep with me. If you cry under me, I’ll give you a thousand.  \nIf you curse, two thousand.  \nIf you cry *and* curse, five thousand.”*\n\nShinju proposes to buy a night with Yeonseo...\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/945075635), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000116887), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=924002525)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/qlflsso_)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/945089868)",
